## Read the status {% #status %}

The {% ui key="client:module.status" /%} card on the module page tells you what the plugin is doing now:

- **No wheel event is running.** The bot waits until one starts.
- **There are not enough tickets to spin and still keep** your reserve. The bot waits for more tickets.
- **Today's limit of** spins **is reached.** The bot spins again tomorrow.
- **The game refused a spin.** The bot tries again later. The log line says why.
- **Both wheels are switched off in the settings.** Turn one on and save.

## Tips and limits {% #tips %}

- Tickets do not expire between wheel events. A reserve you keep now is still there for the next event.
- The bot does not take part in the spin contest that some wheel events run. It spins only to use your tickets.

## Related errors {% #errors %}

If a number is outside its range when you save, the app shows [PLUGIN_OPTION_RANGE](/errors/#plugin-option-range).
